<p>NOTE: The company said operating income in the third quarter excluded net realized gains of $5.3 million or $0.05 per share and losses of $3.4 million or $0.03 per share on securities sales. Year-to-date results included net realized gains on security sales of $1.2 million or $0.01 per share compared $42.8 million or $0.37 per share last year.</p>
